                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/releases/tag/v13.3.4"&gt;Aspire 13.3.4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's New in Aspire 13.3.4&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Patch release for Aspire 13.3 with a fix for the Aspire skill description exceeding agent host limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🐛 Fixes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📝 &lt;strong&gt;Aspire skill description too long for agent hosts&lt;/strong&gt; — The &lt;code&gt;SKILL.md&lt;/code&gt; generated by &lt;code&gt;aspire agent init&lt;/code&gt; included a frontmatter description that exceeded the 1024-character limit enforced by agent hosts such as Codex and Copilot CLI, causing the Aspire skill to fail to load. The bundled skill description has been shortened to stay within the limit. (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4461938271" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17183" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17183/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17183"&gt;#17183&lt;/a&gt;, backported via &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4462671379" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17188" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17188/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17188"&gt;#17188&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🏷️ Housekeeping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Bumped branding to 13.3.4 (&lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4471168857" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/issues/17215" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/microsoft/aspire/pull/17215/hovercard" href="https://github.com/microsoft/aspire/pull/17215"&gt;#17215&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
